1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,400
Scientists built a robot

2
00:00:01,440 --> 00:00:03,480
that CRAWLS through your intestines.

3
00:00:03,520 --> 00:00:05,225
And this thing has tiny spikes

4
00:00:05,265 --> 00:00:06,850
that pop out of its body.

5
00:00:06,890 --> 00:00:08,105
They grip the slippery walls

6
00:00:08,145 --> 00:00:09,345
while inflatable chambers

7
00:00:09,385 --> 00:00:10,300
push it forward,

8
00:00:10,340 --> 00:00:11,720
almost like a snake.

9
00:00:11,760 --> 00:00:13,810
Researchers tested it inside pigs,

10
00:00:13,850 --> 00:00:14,735
where it traveled over

11
00:00:14,775 --> 00:00:16,830
SIX FEET through their intestines.

12
00:00:16,870 --> 00:00:18,200
It could even take tissue samples

13
00:00:18,240 --> 00:00:19,430
and deliver liquid.

14
00:00:19,470 --> 00:00:21,150
It’s still experimental.

15
00:00:21,190 --> 00:00:22,090
But one day,

16
00:00:22,130 --> 00:00:23,475
the thing exploring your gut

17
00:00:23,515 --> 00:00:25,660
might actually be crawling through it.

